+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Rong Bao <rong.bao@csmantle.top>
+Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:06:59 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH 07/11] wasm2c: fix SIMD_FORCE_READ for RISC-V and PPC64LE
+
+Link: https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2878
+Link: https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2880
+---
+ .../src/prebuilt/wasm2c_simd_source_declarations.cc       | 8 ++++++--
+ 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
+
+diff --git a/third_party/wasm2c/src/prebuilt/wasm2c_simd_source_declarations.cc b/third_party/wasm2c/src/prebuilt/wasm2c_simd_source_declarations.cc
